---
description: Use Kling AI for image, video, motion, asset, account, and task requests
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

For Kling requests, use `$kling-ai` and route creative work to
`$kling-ai-generate-image` or `$kling-ai-generate-video`. Use only the
configured `kling-ai` Global MCP at `https://kling.ai/mcp/plugin`.
For prompt-only or storyboard-only requests, deliver the text without MCP calls.
During generation preparation, discover live model capabilities across relevant
tools, including `omni_ref_video` when available. Recommend V4 when an eligible
pair supports the request. Confirm final billable settings before generation
unless the same unsubmitted intent and unchanged settings are already explicitly
authorized. Submit each confirmed intent at most once.

Let a mounted generation MCP App refresh its own task. If no App is mounted
and a `generationId` is known, query at the provider-permitted interval until
terminal, cancelled, or the turn cannot continue. Report completion only after
terminal success with usable primary media. Query once for an explicit standalone
status request with a known task ID. Never switch regions or start or depend on
a local Kling MCP server.
